{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53136","headline":"五言答李师尚 · 皎然","name":"五言答李师尚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雅篇忽见遗，婉□开缄发。\n惠风摇精思，琼蕋疑花□。\n（下缺）（见《四部丛刊》本《皎然集》卷一）（按：《皎然集》录此诗四句後，尚有「空门青山月」至「来税丘中辙」共七句。\n检《全唐诗》卷八一五，此七句爲《酬李司直纵诸公冬日游妙喜寺题照昱二上人房寄长城潘丞述》一诗之末七句。\n可知原本在《五言答李师尚》前四行後，适有缺页或缺行，刊刻者不审，遂将二诗合成一篇，今爲析出。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}